rypha and Gnostic writings are key topics.\"}],\"instructors\":[{\"name\":\"To be announced\",\"professional_title\":\"Senior Lecturer of History of the Biblical Canon\",\"photo\":\"320\"}],\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"meta_keywords\":null,\"og_image\":null,\"created_by\":59,\"status\":1,\"intake_status\":1,\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-15T00:20:04.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-16T04:04:59.000000Z\"}',NULL,'2026-02-10 06:28:44',1,59,NULL,'2026-02-09 12:09:19','2026-02-10 06:28:44'),
